OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court charged with murder
OL,4,Aafter body discovered in flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 33-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with murder after the body of a
OL,8,F53-year-old was found inside a flat in
OL,9,Fthe early hours of Saturday.
OL,11,FMartin Joseph Ward, from Holyhead,
OL,12,FAnglesey, was arrested after the body
OL,13,Fof a man was discovered and pronounced
OL,14,Fdead at the scene on 17 October.
OL,16,FHe appeared at Llandudno Magistrates'
OL,17,FCourt on Monday wearing a grey jumper
OL,18,Fand only spoke to confirm his name,
OL,19,Fdate of birth and that he understood
OL,20,Fthat his case was being transferred to
OL,21,Fthe crown court.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
