OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court charged with murder
OL,4,Aafter body discovered in flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistrict Judge Gwyn Jones told him he
OL,7,Fmust stay in custody and would next
OL,8,Fappear before Caernarfon Crown Court on
OL,9,FTuesday.
